the things that you do need

00:26:51.050 --> 00:26:54.450
in your enterprise to make this
really useful and valuable.

00:26:54.450 --> 00:26:56.200
So it would be a great
partnership for you

00:26:56.200 --> 00:26:57.700
to just help take this survey.

00:26:57.700 --> 00:27:00.476
All right, can you
guys flip back?

00:27:00.476 --> 00:27:01.380
Cool.

00:27:01.380 --> 00:27:05.950
All right, so
g.co/cloud/privatecatalogsurvey.

00:27:05.950 --> 00:27:06.450
All right?

